File name: KKGRLOO2.MP
Path description: Kobold Tunnels, without King, and converts cash.
Path starts: Kobold Guardroom.
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 5
Level recommendation: 10-15
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: kobold, kobold warrior, centipede.
Additional information:

Included in the zip are KOBTKKGR.MP, KOBKKKGR.MP, KKGRKOBK.MP and KKGRKOBT.MP
which are paths to and from the start of this loop.

This loop also converts cash it collects by buying and selling iron rations.
It lowers the exp rate a little, results in 1.5p per hour though.
